  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Two coils of self inductance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are connected in series combination having mutual inductance of the coils as <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>. The equivalent self inductance of the combination will be</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0056_cadaeae6f6d8.png\" style=\"width: 220px; height: 69px;\" /></p>"
  },
